00:27:28,280 --> 00:27:30,000
Robots don't have any feelings.

198
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:32,280
They don't feel sad to see their kids hungry.

199
00:27:32,280 --> 00:27:33,600
So I guess it's not that bad.

200
00:27:33,600 --> 00:27:35,520
But in fact, it's a human being.

201
00:27:35,520 --> 00:27:38,600
And we seem to be an extra reason to want them here.

202
00:27:38,600 --> 00:27:40,880
Well, but you understand, human beings do bad things.

203
00:27:40,880 --> 00:27:43,160
Oh, that's the thing I didn't understand.

204
00:27:43,160 --> 00:27:45,440
Well, they also do good things.

205
00:27:45,440 --> 00:27:49,520
And on average, when we just look around the world,

206
00:27:49,520 --> 00:27:52,360
seems like human beings must, on balance, be a good thing.

207
00:27:52,360 --> 00:27:54,040
Because otherwise, the world would

208
00:27:54,040 --> 00:27:56,560
