00:31:00,600 --> 00:31:02,640
If we're able to get rid of agriculture

287
00:31:02,640 --> 00:31:05,960
as a source of employment for virtually all purposes,

288
00:31:05,960 --> 00:31:08,000
but we can't get rid of the other stuff we've got

