00:31:39,280 --> 00:31:42,080
no reason why we couldn't put everybody back to work.

303
00:31:42,080 --> 00:31:43,360
There's still plenty of stuff.

304
00:31:43,360 --> 00:31:45,560
There's plenty of unmet wants.

