310
00:31:55,760 --> 00:31:58,360
There's nothing left to do.

311
00:31:58,360 --> 00:31:59,920
I could just think of tons of stuff.

312
00:31:59,920 --> 00:32:01,760
But we have the advantage of hindsight.

313
00:32:01,760 --> 00:32:03,720
We know what has been done since then.

314
00:32:03,720 --> 00:32:05,840
But you go and name stuff that is going to happen

