442
00:57:00,760 --> 00:57:02,680
and the benefits happen later on.

443
00:57:03,600 --> 00:57:06,760
On the other hand, if people's working lives increase,

444
00:57:06,760 --> 00:57:08,880
does that mean that it makes more or less sense

445
00:57:08,880 --> 00:57:09,720
to go to school?

446
00:57:11,040 --> 00:57:13,080
More sense because you get to cash in on the benefits

447
00:57:13,080 --> 00:57:15,760
for a larger number of years, of course.

448
00:57:15,760 --> 00:57:17,040
All right.

449
00:57:17,040 --> 00:57:18,320
Okay.

