00:58:06,880 --> 00:58:09,440
Right, so, and on the other side,

474
00:58:09,440 --> 00:58:11,280
and since it is unusual for graduate students

475
00:58:11,280 --> 00:58:12,120
to have a published paper,

476
00:58:12,120 --> 00:58:14,560
this means that by getting one published paper,

477
00:58:14,560 --> 00:58:17,080
you are quickly, you are by that step alone

478
00:58:17,080 --> 00:58:20,400
putting yourself into a much better pool.

479
00:58:20,400 --> 00:58:23,000
Although, of course, there's no guarantees.

480
00:58:23,000 --> 00:58:24,720
Yes, all right.

481
00:58:24,720 --> 00:58:26,640
Now, something much more mundane

482
00:58:26,640 --> 00:58:29,760
about putting your CV on fancy paper when you mail it out.

