00:59:48,320 --> 00:59:50,720
So this is a topic that I spent 18 months

520
00:59:50,720 --> 00:59:52,600
just doing spreadsheets on.

521
00:59:52,600 --> 00:59:55,240
So if I, you know, so now I really do know,

