as analogous to the amount of time you spend practicing

122
01:24:52,680 --> 01:24:53,200
the sport.

123
01:24:53,200 --> 01:24:58,700
And then IQ you would think of as analogous to raw talent.

124
01:24:58,700 --> 01:25:00,760
So it could be your height or your weight or your strength

125
01:25:00,760 --> 01:25:01,880
