01:41:23,860 --> 01:41:26,500
And this one is 100% totally true.

35
01:41:26,900 --> 01:41:27,540
Imperfection.

36
01:41:27,740 --> 01:41:28,920
The tests aren't perfect.

37
01:41:29,340 --> 01:41:30,140
They totally are.

38
01:41:30,800 --> 01:41:31,120
All right.

