01:42:07,940 --> 01:42:08,640
So get ready.

56
01:42:08,640 --> 01:42:10,540
Strap in. And then he did really well.

57
01:42:11,440 --> 01:42:11,660
All right.

58
01:42:11,660 --> 01:42:13,500
So there are different reasons and yes,

